## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical edge deployment, OTA rollout, and telemetry-driven governance for real-world industrial settings.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Edge Manager OTA workflow
- Canary and phased rollouts with rollback triggers
- Telemetry-driven monitoring (latency, errors, drift)
- Edge manifest versioning and cryptographic signing
- Cost governance and access control

